B.ecs=new A.d_("t14",B.cN,"Five-song playlist","Make a shared playlist of five songs: three from you, two from them \u2014 then swap.","",B.C7)
B.ecP=new A.d_("t15",B.cN,"An open door",'Ask: "Is there anything on your heart you haven\u2019t told me yet?" \u2014 and just listen.',"",B.Yk)
B.ecY=new A.d_("h1",B.lZ,"Love feels safe","Healthy love feels safe. You can disagree, say no, see friends and family, and still be loved. Respect is not a reward \u2014 it\u2019s the floor.","",B.xV)
B.ech=new A.d_("h2",B.lZ,"Love doesn\u2019t control","Checking your phone, controlling who you see, threats, or making you afraid are not signs of love. They are warning signs, whatever the reason given.","",B.xV)
B.eLY=s(["space","calm"],t.s)
B.eca=new A.d_("h3",B.lZ,"Boundaries are care",'Boundaries aren\u2019t walls \u2014 they tell the person you love how to love you well. "I need a little time to think" is a healthy thing to say.',"",B.eLY)
B.ecn=new A.d_("h4",B.lZ,"If you ever feel unsafe","Protecting your relationship never means staying where you are hurt or afraid. If you feel unsafe, reach out \u2014 in Tanzania you can call 116 (free, 24/7) or the police on 112.","",B.xV)
